{"title":"푸른 하늘의 랩소디","artist":"사토 준이치","sourceId":"reference:F1srILtY4e6uwA1kXEuW","sourceHash":"ccf82bdd2e533ff0396959775a90caab713f02b3ff9202e598485588d6904c48","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.28,"end":3.2800000000000002,"text":"Chu-chu, yeah!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":4.13,"end":7.13,"text":"Please me!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":7.62,"end":10.620000000000001,"text":"Chu-chu yeah!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":11.04,"end":14.04,"text":"Without you!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":16.7,"end":19.7,"text":"あー！ なんてことだ 些細な過ちだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":20.38,"end":23.38,"text":"自分のことに タララッタラッタ 手焼く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":24.07,"end":27.07,"text":"どうして突然？ 逃げ切ったっていいでしょ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":27.62,"end":30.62,"text":"だけど なんだか気まぐれモードになり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":30.83,"end":33.12,"text":"そんな気分になっちゃって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":33.12,"end":36.12,"text":"始まりはそんな風で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":36.51,"end":39.51,"text":"つまりはらしくないようで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":40.19,"end":43.19,"text":"でも今じゃ扉開けてほら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":43.71,"end":46.71,"text":"声が聴こえるよ さあ！行こう！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":48.73,"end":50.77,"text":"どこへでも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":50.77,"end":53.77,"text":"僕は君の翼になれる勇気があるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":57.45,"end":60.45,"text":"どんな試練も怖くない その魔法があるから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":64.62,"end":67.62,"text":"初めて出会う世界に 花束を贈ろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":71.82,"end":74.82,"text":"ただこの瞬間結ばれるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":75.59,"end":77.39,"text":"ちぐはぐなコミュニケーション？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":77.39,"end":79.1,"text":"でも別に構わない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":79.1,"end":82.1,"text":"明日から平和なら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":83.93,"end":86.93,"text":"Chu-chu, yeah!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":87.46000000000001,"end":90.46000000000001,"text":"Without you!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":91.46000000000001,"end":94.46000000000001,"text":"あー！ どうしてまた 素直になれなくて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":95.19,"end":98.19,"text":"自分のことで チュルルッチュルッチュ 火吹く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":98.72,"end":101.72,"text":"ギアはそのまま スピード上げていこう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":102.28,"end":105.28,"text":"だけどなんだか黄昏モードになり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":105.68,"end":107.75999999999999,"text":"いつかを思い出しちゃって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":107.75999999999999,"end":110.75999999999999,"text":"一人でいても嫌じゃない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":111.33,"end":114.33,"text":"誰にも頼らなくてもいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":115.03,"end":118.03,"text":"でも扉の向こう騒がしい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":118.44,"end":121.37,"text":"声が聞きたいよ 今","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":121.37,"end":123.45,"text":"行こう！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":123.45,"end":125.29,"text":"どこへでも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":125.29,"end":128.29000000000002,"text":"僕は 君を背中に乗せて 空を舞うよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":132.18,"end":135.18,"text":"いつか心が離れても その時は笑ってて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":139.23,"end":142.23,"text":"守りたいこの世界に 青空のラプソディ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":146.26,"end":149.26,"text":"ただいつまでも奏でていてよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":150.2,"end":152.07,"text":"凸凹なコンビネーション？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":152.07,"end":153.78,"text":"でも別に大丈夫さ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":153.78,"end":155.71,"text":"明日はまた平和だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":155.71,"end":158.71,"text":"ほんの小さな傷を 太陽にさらして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":162.67000000000002,"end":165.67000000000002,"text":"分け合ったよ君と 痛みは熱さの中に溶けてく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":172.7,"end":175.7,"text":"(Chu-chu, yeah) 粋なビート弾く僕ら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":176.46,"end":179.46,"text":"(Please me) 手を叩いて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":179.84,"end":182.84,"text":"(Chu-chu, yeah) ブギーなリズムではしゃぐ二人","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":183.45,"end":186.45,"text":"(Without you) 飛び跳ねてさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":187.07,"end":190.07,"text":"(Chu-chu, yeah) 粋なビート弾く僕ら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":190.37,"end":193.37,"text":"(Please me) 手を叩いて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":194.25,"end":197.25,"text":"(Chu-chu, yeah) ブギーなリズムではしゃぐアリーナ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":219.57,"end":221.47,"text":"どこまでも！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":221.47,"end":224.47,"text":"僕は君の翼に なれる勇気があるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":228.28,"end":231.28,"text":"どんな試練も怖くない その魔法があるから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":235.53,"end":238.53,"text":"君と出会い世界は 花束に溢れた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":242.53,"end":245.53,"text":"ただその瞬間結ばれたよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":246.28,"end":248.16,"text":"ちぐはぐなコミュニケーション？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":248.16,"end":249.72,"text":"でも別に構わない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":249.72,"end":252.72,"text":"明日が平和なら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":254.57,"end":257.57,"text":"Chu-chu, yeah!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":258.22,"end":261.22,"text":"Please me!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":261.86,"end":264.86,"text":"息を切らし","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":265.1,"end":268.1,"text":"Without you!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}